+For an exception discovered after freezing, the implementer preserves the obstacle and routes it to the supervisor. The supervisor records authorization using [CHANGE](../templates/CHANGE.md), retains original expectations, inventories and execution evidence, and freezes a new acceptance/check revision identifying the substitute or skipped test and remaining checks. Invalidate affected evidence and execute the revised checks before acceptance. This is delegated authority for the recorded testing exception, not permission to weaken assertions to make a failing behavior pass. Keep the exception decision in reviewer-visible acceptance/evidence, outside excluded plans and conversations.
