+For a reviewer-discovered coverage gap: reviewer preserves finding plus executable reproduction when feasible; otherwise records the obstacle for the testing-exception process. Planner confirms it tests an existing requirement; supervisor may authorize an **additive verifier revision** under this delegated policy. Retain the original inventory/checks unchanged, freeze the new revision and execute it against the candidate before acceptance. Outside the testing-exception policy, requirements, weakened expectations or verifier corrections beyond additive coverage need explicit authorization. A baseline revision invalidates affected evidence without erasing prior attempts.
 
